{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Retourtje Sachsenhausen, interview 10"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:40937"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M de Jong"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De heer Veenstra werd als student in 1941 door de Duitsers opgepakt vanwege Engelandvaren. Hij werd gedeporteerd naar Sachsenhausen, waar hij als typist werkte in de Heinkelfabrieken. Hij had vergeleken bij veel andere gevangenen een bevoorrechte positie in het kamp. Hij heeft meegelopen met de dodenmars. Nu heeft hij nauwelijks meer last van zijn vierjarige kampervaringen.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Engelandvaren"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sachsenhausen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Heinkelfabriek"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Zandcommando"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dodenmars"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2008-09-27"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Theo van den Aker"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-03-09"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2008-09-27"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Het project 'Retourtje Sachsenhausen' behandelt de deportaties van gevangenen vanuit Kamp Vught naar concentratiekamp Sachsenhausen. Hoewel er gedurende de hele oorlog gevangenen vanuit Vught naar Sachsenhausen werden afgevoerd, zijn de treinen die op 5 en 6 september 1944 vertrokken het meest berucht. Zo'n drieduizend mannen werden toen gedeporteerd, slechts de helft keerde terug.<br><br>Bij de Sachsenhausen-herdenking in september 2006 riep een oud-gevangene zijn mede-slachtoffers op om over hun ervaringen in de concentratiekampen Vught en Sachsenhausen te vertellen, omdat er niet lang meer overlevenden zullen zijn die hun verhalen kunnen doorgeven. Deze oproep was voor de gemeente Vught aanleiding het initiatief te nemen voor het project 'Retourtje Sachsenhausen'. Samen met het Vughts Historisch Museum en Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught is het project uitgewerkt. Het project bestaat uit drie onderdelen: het vastleggen van wat er gebeurd is d.m.v. 11 interviews met overlevenden, een documentaire waarin een overlevende de reis per trein nogmaals maakt, vergezeld van een scholier die hem daarover vragen stelt. Het derde deel bestaat uit een lespakket voor middelbare scholen.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Yes"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social sciences"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Sociale wetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/ce21b6fb-4283-4194-9369-b3ff4c3d76e7","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/3d7d49e9-b827-4ee4-83ec-76e4a5934c